      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Routine event, about 9 in 10",
      "items": [
        "The shared worker answers with the model and Gateway tools",
        "No microVM starts, so no per-tenant compute bills while idle",
        "Illustrative estimate: $1.67 against $4.11 per tenant-month"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Code event, about 1 in 10",
      "items": [
        "The worker sends one complete task, not separate file and process calls",
        "The tenant's runtime session ends 5 minutes after it goes idle",
        "Workspace credentials last 15 minutes and work only through the VPC endpoint"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Tenant isolation",
      "items": [
        "The tenant comes from the sign-in token, never the request body",
        "Every data credential carries a TenantId STS session tag",
        "The Gateway interceptor checks a KMS-signed tenant context",
        "IAM scopes S3 prefixes, KMS context and DynamoDB leading keys"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "slate",
      "title": "Not drawn",
      "items": [
        "The worker also updates the coordination record",
        "DNS Firewall lets the runtime resolve AWS domains only",
        "A failed turn retries after 30 s and 2 min, then goes to a dead-letter queue"
